        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: John Delaney\n- Places: Maryland's 6th congressional district, Maryland, Washington, D.C.\n- Roles: United States Representative, presidential candidate\n- Organizations: Democratic Party\n\nFacts:\n- John Kevin Delaney was born on April 16, 1963.\n- John Delaney is an American politician and businessman.\n- John Delaney has represented Maryland's 6th congressional district in the United States House of Representatives since 2013.\n- Maryland's 6th congressional district is the second-largest district in Maryland.\n- Maryland's 6th congressional district includes nearly all of western Maryland, and most of its votes come from the outer suburbs of Washington, D.C.\n- John Delaney is a member of the Democratic Party.\n- John Delaney is currently the representative for Maryland's 6th congressional district.\n- John Delaney was running for President of the United States in 2020.",
